<title>POLAND: VISTULA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.85 vs    0.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.55 vs    1.53</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.21 vs    1.37</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 9.72 vs    8.51</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.62 vs    6.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   13.30 vs    9.01</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.51 vs    6.95</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	72.47 vs   61.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
